SUMMARY:TDRR #17 Weekday Morning Ride\, Farmersville Short Ride (20R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Debbie Walburn\n\n
 Celebrate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute to
  the event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and Rid
 ing our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose P
 age](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&
 module_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR S
 chedule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257
 148&module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://routes
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-farmersville-short-ride-20r/)\n\nTour de Red
  Rose & LBC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Chan
 ges and Weather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=e
 n#!forum/lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\n
 Helmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and 
 basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nBeing 
 a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://w
 ww.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RS
 VP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lanc
 bikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=
 323984) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conte
 nt.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\, and [Ride Waiver](ht
 tps://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154405
 64/
